[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0367","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0367.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0184","title":"ISC BIND 动态DNS更新不当漏洞","description":"BIND DNS 服务器在编译时启用 -DALLOW_UPDATES 选项后，会允许未经验证的动态 DNS 更新请求。远程攻击者可利用该功能向目标服务器发送恶意动态更新数据包，从而篡改或添加 DNS 记录，导致域名解析劫持、流量重定向等严重后果。该漏洞影响多种 Unix/Linux 系统上运行的 BIND 服务，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0184"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-07-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:46Z","remediation":"重新编译 BIND 时移除 -DALLOW_UPDATES 编译选项以禁用动态更新功能；如业务需要动态 DNS 更新，请在 named.conf 中使用 allow-update ACL 限定仅允许信任网段（如 10.0.0.0/8）发起更新请求，并配置 TSIG 密钥签名认证确保更新来源合法性；同时升级至 BIND 9.x 或更高版本以获取完整的访问控制和身份验证机制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0184"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0367.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0318","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0318.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0153","title":"Microsoft Windows 3.11/95/NT NetBIOS 带外数据拒绝服务漏洞（WinNuke）","description":"Windows 95/NT 系统的 NetBIOS 协议实现存在缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的 139 端口发送特制的 OOB（Out of Band）带外数据包，触发系统内存访问异常，导致目标系统蓝屏崩溃（BSOD），造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows 3.11/95/NT 3.5.1/NT 4.0 等早期版本，攻击无需认证，利用门槛极低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0153"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-07-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:42Z","remediation":"升级到 Windows 2000 及以上版本（WinNuke 攻击已在后续版本中修复）。若无法升级，在防火墙或路由器上阻止外部对 TCP 端口 139（NetBIOS Session Service）和 137（NetBIOS Name Service）的入站访问；在网络属性中解除「Microsoft 网络的文件和打印机共享」绑定以关闭 NetBIOS over TCP/IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1666","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20440","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/269e5b2b6ea60fdb4a03411be38d3e381b26e4c4/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0153.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0153","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0153.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0153.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2f876a2c24d5ccd5bbd081f09e801e580536456a/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0153.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/49899a53e9c2e620c99e0234afe3c50e512ad851/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g9jq-2w39-657g/GHSA-g9jq-2w39-657g.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/W/winnuke.nasl","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.194"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0318.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0310","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0310.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0150","title":"Perl fingerd 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Perl 实现的 fingerd 程序存在远程命令执行漏洞。由于 fingerd 在处理远程用户输入的查询参数时未经过滤直接传递给系统命令执行，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标主机的 finger 服务（tcp/79）发送特制请求，在目标系统上以 fingerd 运行权限执行任意命令，从而完全控制受影响主机。该漏洞影响多个 Unix 系统上使用 Perl 实现的 fingerd 程序，无需认证即可远程利用，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0150"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-07-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:42Z","remediation":"立即停用并移除 finger 服务（该协议已过时），或升级到不受影响的版本。如必须运行 finger 服务，务必对用户输入进行严格的 shell 元字符过滤，避免将输入直接传递给 `system()`、`exec()`、反引号等命令执行函数；同时在防火墙层面阻止外部对 79/TCP 端口的访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0150"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0310.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0301","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0301.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0147","title":"Glimpse GlimpseHTTP/WebGlimpse 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"GlimpseHTTP 1.0/2.0 及 WebGlimpse 1.0 的 aglimpse CGI 程序存在管道命令注入漏洞，未对用户输入进行有效过滤，导致远程未授权攻击者可通过向 aglimpse CGI 发送包含管道符（|）及任意命令的恶意请求，实现远程任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 GlimpseHTTP 1.0/2.0 及 WebGlimpse 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、机密性/完整性/可用性均受部分影响。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，通过构造包含管道命令注入载荷的 HTTP 请求即可在服务器上以 Web 服务进程权限执行任意系统命令。ExploitDB 已收录公开 PoC (EDB-ID: 20449)。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0147"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"1997-07-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:41Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用 Web 服务器中所有 aglimpse CGI 脚本（通常位于 cgi-bin/aglimpse）。若仍在使用 GlimpseHTTP/WebGlimpse，建议立即迁移至现代搜索引擎（如 Elasticsearch、Algolia）或静态站点搜索方案，该软件已于 1990 年代末停止维护且无官方补丁。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器配置中禁止 CGI 执行或通过防火墙屏蔽对 /cgi-bin/aglimpse 的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0147","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20449","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0147.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0147","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-1999-0147.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0147.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j92f-fc3c-68gj/GHSA-j92f-fc3c-68gj.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0147.json","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.844","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c4e9ad3b-8019-4891-afe7-a95201b39d7c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0301.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0301.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0301.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0252","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0252.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0111","title":"IBM AIX RIP v1 路由欺骗漏洞","description":"RIP v1 是一种距离向量路由协议，其设计缺陷在于未对路由更新报文进行身份认证，导致攻击者可通过伪造 RIP 广播报文向目标系统注入虚假路由条目。AIX 系统上运行的 RIP v1 服务存在欺骗漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可在同一广播域内发送精心构造的 RIP 响应报文，篡改目标主机的路由表，将流量重定向至攻击者控制的恶意节点，进而实现中间人攻击、信息窃取或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 AIX 系统上启用了 RIP v1 服务的配置，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0111"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-07-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:36Z","remediation":"建议升级支持 RIPv2 的路由软件以启用 MD5 认证，或迁移至 OSPF 等认证型路由协议；在边界路由器上配置被动接口并实施 RIP 路由过滤（distribute-list），仅允许与已知邻居通信，阻断伪造 RIP 路由更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0111"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0252.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0188","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0188.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0076","title":"WU wu-ftpd PASV命令缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"wu-ftpd 的 PASV 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标 FTP 服务器发送特制的 PASV 命令请求触发该漏洞，导致 wu-ftpd 进程崩溃并产生 core dump 文件。该漏洞影响早期版本的 wu-ftpd 服务程序，攻击者无需身份认证即可触发拒绝服务，在特定环境下可能进一步实现远程代码执行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0076"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-07-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:31Z","remediation":"立即升级 wu-ftpd 至 2.6.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 PASV 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可在 wu-ftpd 配置文件中限制 PASV 命令的使用范围，或在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 服务（端口 21）的访问来源 IP。鉴于 wu-ftpd 已停止维护，建议迁移至 vsftpd 或 ProFTPD 等仍在活跃维护的 FTP 服务器软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0076"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0188.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0186","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0186.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0074","title":"Linux Kernel TCP 端口顺序分配欺骗漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 TCP 协议栈在分配监听端口时采用顺序递增方式，导致远程攻击者可通过预测后续端口号实施 TCP 会话劫持与 IP 欺骗攻击。该漏洞影响早期 Linux 内核版本，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可在未建立连接的条件下伪造 TCP 数据包，破坏通信完整性。后续内核版本改用了随机端口分配机制修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0074"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-07-01T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:31Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.0.40 或 2.2.27 及以上版本，这些版本已实现 RFC 1948 随机化 TCP 序列号机制。如无法升级，可通过 sysctl 启用 tcp_tw_reuse 和 tcp_syncookies 提升抗欺骗能力，并在网络边界配置 ACL 限制源地址伪造。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0074"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0186.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0807","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0807.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0541","title":"多个厂商 WWW 服务存在可猜测密码漏洞","description":"WWW URL 访问密码可被猜测或暴力破解，攻击者通过常见弱口令字典或自动化枚举工具即可获取受保护资源的未授权访问权限，受影响的 Web 应用可能因此泄露敏感数据、遭受未授权操作或完全被攻击者控制。该漏洞影响广泛，涉及使用 HTTP 基本认证或表单认证的多种 Web 服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0541"],"sources":["cve","epss"],"published":"1997-07-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"使用强密码策略（大小写字母、数字、特殊字符组合，长度不少于12位），部署账户锁定机制和多因素认证，避免使用默认凭据或常见弱口令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T23:58:38Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0541"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0807.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0798","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0798.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0532","title":"DNS 服务器区域传输未授权访问信息泄露漏洞","description":"DNS 区域传输（Zone Transfer）是 DNS 主从服务器间同步域名数据库的标准机制。当 DNS 服务器未正确限制区域传输的发起来源时，任意远程攻击者均可通过发送 AXFR 查询请求获取该域名的全部 DNS 记录，包括 A/AAAA 记录、MX 邮件交换记录、CNAME 别名记录、NS 名称服务器记录及 TXT 文本记录等。攻击者利用这些信息可绘制目标网络的完整拓扑结构，识别关键服务器 IP 地址，为后续针对性攻击（如 DDoS 放大攻击、钓鱼攻击）提供情报支撑。该漏洞通常由 DNS 服务器配置不当导致，影响 BIND、Microsoft DNS Server 等主流 DNS 服务软件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0532"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-07-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"限制区域传输仅允许授权的从服务器 IP 地址，在 BIND 中使用 allow-transfer 配置项或设置成 none，并启用 TSIG 签名认证机制增强传输安全性，定期审计 DNS 服务器日志监控异常 AXFR 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0532","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0532","https://github.com/websecnl/Bulk_CVE-1999-0532_Scanner","https://github.com/Rodney-O-C-Melby/dns-zone-transfer-test","https://github.com/SleepTheGod/dns-zone-audit"],"poc_urls":["https://github.com/websecnl/Bulk_CVE-1999-0532_Scanner","https://github.com/Rodney-O-C-Melby/dns-zone-transfer-test"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0798.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0798.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0340","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0340.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0169","title":"NFS 虚假UID认证绕过漏洞","description":"NFS（网络文件系统）协议存在认证缺陷，其基于 UID（用户 ID）的访问控制机制未对客户端身份进行有效验证。远程攻击者无需合法凭据，仅需在 NFS 请求中伪造特权用户（如 root）的 UID 值，即可绕过文件权限检查，实现对目标系统上任意文件的读取与写入操作。该漏洞影响广泛部署的 NFS 服务实现，CVSS v2 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，可导致敏感数据泄露、系统文件篡改乃至完全控制服务器。由于 NFS 协议设计阶段未内置强认证机制，此问题属于架构性安全缺陷。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0169"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-07-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"1997-07-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 NFS 服务端至 NFSv4 版本，配置 /etc/exports 中启用 root_squash 和 all_squash 选项强制将远程用户映射为匿名用户，避免直接绕过权限检查；同时使用 sec=krb5 或 sec=krb5p 启用 Kerberos 认证，防止客户端伪造 UID/GID。在无法升级的场景下，应在防火墙层面限制 NFS 端口（2049/TCP/UDP）仅允许受信 IP 段访问，并使用 exports 的 rw/ro 和 subnet 限制作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0340.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0325","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0325.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0156","title":"wu-ftpd FTP 守护进程认证绕过漏洞","description":"wu-ftpd FTP 服务程序存在认证绕过漏洞，远程攻击者无需有效凭据即可使用任意用户名和密码组合成功登录目标服务器。该漏洞源于 wu-ftpd 在用户身份验证过程中未正确校验账户凭证，导致攻击者可绕过认证机制获取服务器访问权限，进而读取、上传或删除文件。此漏洞影响所有使用 wu-ftpd 的早期 Unix/Linux 系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0156"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-07-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 wu-ftpd 至 2.5 及以上版本，或停止使用已停止维护的 wu-ftpd，迁移至 vsftpd、ProFTPD 等仍在维护的 FTP 服务端。如无法立即迁移，可在防火墙层面限制对 FTP 端口（21）的访问来源 IP，并禁用匿名登录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-1999-0156","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0156"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0325.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1269","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1269.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1423","title":"Sun Solaris ping 命令本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Solaris ping 命令本地拒绝服务漏洞","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1423"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-06-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:24Z","remediation":"升级至 Solaris 7 或更高版本以修复 ping 对多播地址通过回环接口的本地拒绝服务问题。如无法升级，通过限制本地用户执行 ping 命令权限（如从 cron/at 环境移除 ping 的 setuid 位）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602558319160&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602558319171&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602558319180&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87602558319181&w=2","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/146","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7492.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/209","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19161","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/48e2428aa9b9856f01006cca01971bc2ae076616/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1423.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1423","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1423.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/715601c34bbee046275188561ed6152c0e14bde6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1423.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/de3f834577328e71a123358d1db2b1637bc19e8a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c9v3-wqvp-m35p/GHSA-c9v3-wqvp-m35p.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154400_154500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000180.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5021047a-6ef5-4bd6-8286-cf4944b703c9.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1423.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1269.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1385","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1385.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1192","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9116,\"outputTokens\":19,\"totalTokens\":10799}}","description":"Solaris 2.5.1 及更早版本的 eeprom 命令存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过传递超长命令行参数触发栈溢出，覆盖返回地址并执行任意代码，从而将权限提升至 root。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.5.1 及更早版本，攻击者需具备本地登录权限，通过构造超长参数字符串触发栈溢出劫持控制流，最终获取 root 权限实现本地提权。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1192"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-06-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:54Z","remediation":"升级 Sun Solaris 至 2.6 或 Solaris 7 及以上已修复版本（相应补丁为 103630/103630-12 等）。如无法立即升级，应限制普通用户对 eeprom 命令的执行权限（如移除 setuid 位或用 sudo 限定授权用户），并强化本地账户访问控制以缓解本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/143","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7444.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/206","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/786262dea273b0bddfc7eb6f6950f11b9f01c05c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1192.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1192","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1192.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/165075bb4c3675993ac058501ff8575bd07a9ca0/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1192.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/424512debdca84cc53ffa1fb3810a74f7b1905a5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g3fh-mqxc-5774/GHSA-g3fh-mqxc-5774.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154400_154500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000179.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8a8af7e4-8516-4c12-b569-28cea0f3e94e.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1192.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1385.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1281","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1281.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1483","title":"svgalib zgv HOME 环境变量本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"svgalib 1.2.10 及更早版本中的 zgv 图像查看器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过设置超长的 HOME 环境变量触发缓冲区溢出，进而以当前程序权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 svgalib 1.2.10 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限方可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1483"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-06-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:32Z","remediation":"升级 svgalib 至 1.3.0 或更高版本（该版本修复了 zgv 中 HOME 环境变量的缓冲区溢出问题）。如无法升级，可在启动 zgv 前通过 `export HOME=$(echo $HOME | cut -c1-255)` 截断 HOME 变量长度作为临时缓解，或移除 zgv 的 setuid 权限。建议迁移至现代替代工具（如 feh、sxiv）以彻底规避风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/7041","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/339","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/559e7878a2bcd153513c59154e730dfe23ee3b94/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1483.json","https://git